The Far Realms is a [[Phenomena/Joker World|Joker World]] on the [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/index|Infinite Horizon]], the one the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence/index|Providence]] stands on.

A company from beyond the [[Phenomena/Firmament|firmament]], whose mark is a triangle of sixteen dots, got its start after its founders met a ship full of shipwrecked people in the Far Realms, and its own people were later shipwrecked there in turn. They raised [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/Far Realms/Hesperid 3|Hesperid 3]], a refining works a hundred miles east of the misted crater, and ran a rail north from it to their ship, the [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/Far Realms/Hesperid|Hesperid]], which lies on its side on a gray waste.
